{
	"name": "Draconic Aspect",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/sundries/flags/banner-standard-moon.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p><strong>Passive Effect:</strong> You gain 30ft of Blindsight and 60ft of Darkvision.</p><p><strong>Active Effect: </strong><em><strong>Dragon’s Breath.</strong></em> You can use your action to exhale a magical breath in a 20-foot-long, 5-foot-wide line. Each creature in the area makes a Dexterity saving throw against your Spell DC (or Maneuver DC if you can’t cast spells), taking 4d6 damage on a failed save or half damage on a success.</p><p>The type of damage is chosen upon first taking on the Aspect, based on the type of Dragon the Aspect will channel. The choice is permanent.</p><p>(Black Dragon: Acid, White Dragon: Cold, Red Dragon: Fire, Blue Dragon: Lightning, Shadow Dragon: Necrotic, Green Dragon: Poison)</p>",
